= Algorithm Optimization (IT545)
Level: Graduate

*What you will learn:*

- The theoretical foundations of linear programming and convex optimization.
- How these techniques apply to logistics, economics, and engineering.
- First-order and second-order algorithms for solving optimization problems.
- Practical methods including gradient descent, stochastic gradient descent, proximal gradient descent, Newton methods, and accelerated gradient descent.

